  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Pixel Temperature Converter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Temp Converter</h1>\n    <p class=\"formula\">C → F: x × 9/5 + 32 &nbsp;|&nbsp; F → C: (x − 32) × 5/9</p>\n\n    <label for=\"temperature\">Temperature</label>\n    <input id=\"temperature\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 25\" autocomplete=\"off\" />\n\n    <label for=\"direction\">Direction</label>\n    <select id=\"direction\">\n      <option value=\"c-to-f\">Celsius → Fahrenheit</option>\n      <option value=\"f-to-c\">Fahrenheit → Celsius</option>\n    </select>\n\n    <button id=\"convert\" type=\"button\">Convert</button>\n\n    <label for=\"result\">Result</label>\n    <output id=\"result\" for=\"temperature direction\">--</output>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --card: #2b2d42;\n  --ink: #f4f4f8;\n  --accent: #ffcd75;\n  --accent-dark: #e0a800;\n  --border: #f4f4f8;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  padding: 16px;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, #22243a 25%, transparent 25%),\n    linear-gradient(-45deg, #22243a 25%, transparent 25%),\n    linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 75%, #22243a 75%),\n    linear-gradient(-45deg, transparent 75%, #22243a 75%);\n  background-size: 32px 32px;\n  background-position: 0 0, 0 16px, 16px -16px, -16px 0;\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--ink);\n}\n\n.card {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 420px;\n  padding: 28px 24px;\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--border);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #000;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n.formula {\n  margin: 0 0 8px;\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  opacity: 0.85;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n}\n\ninput,\nselect,\nbutton,\noutput {\n  font: inherit;\n  padding: 12px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  background: #1a1c2c;\n  color: var(--ink);\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\ninput:focus-visible,\nselect:focus-visible,\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  margin-top: 8px;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: #1a1c2c;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #000;\n  transition: transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s, background 0.15s;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: var(--accent-dark);\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(4px, 4px);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 #000;\n}\n\noutput {\n  display: block;\n  min-height: 48px;\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 380px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 20px 16px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 1.15rem;\n  }\n}\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "\"use strict\";\n\nconst tempInput = document.getElementById(\"temperature\");\nconst direction = document.getElementById(\"direction\");\nconst convertBtn = document.getElementById(\"convert\");\nconst result = document.getElementById(\"result\");\n\nfunction cToF(x) {\n  return (x * 9) / 5 + 32;\n}\n\nfunction fToC(x) {\n  return ((x - 32) * 5) / 9;\n}\n\nfunction convert() {\n  const raw = tempInput.value.trim();\n  if (raw === \"\") {\n    result.textContent = \"Error\";\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const value = Number(raw);\n  if (!Number.isFinite(value)) {\n    result.textContent = \"Error\";\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const out = direction.value === \"c-to-f\" ? cToF(value) : fToC(value);\n  result.textContent = out.toFixed(2);\n}\n\nconvertBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", convert);\n\ntempInput.addEventListener(\"keydown\", (event) => {\n  if (event.key === \"Enter\") {\n    convert();\n  }\n});\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Temperature Converter\n\nAn offline, pixel-style temperature converter built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a numeric temperature in the **Temperature** field.\n3. Choose a direction:\n   - **Celsius → Fahrenheit** (`c-to-f`)\n   - **Fahrenheit → Celsius** (`f-to-c`)\n4. Click **Convert** (or press Enter in the input).\n5. The result appears with exactly two decimals and no units.\n\n## Formulas\n\n- Celsius to Fahrenheit: `x * 9/5 + 32`\n- Fahrenheit to Celsius: `(x - 32) * 5/9`\n\n## Error Handling\n\nIf the input is empty, non-numeric, or non-finite (e.g. `Infinity`, `NaN`), the result displays exactly `Error`.\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- All controls have visible labels.\n- Keyboard navigation works with Tab and Enter.\n- Focus states are clearly visible.\n- Layout works from 360px wide.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup and controls\n- `style.css` — pixel-style theme and responsive layout\n- `script.js` — conversion and validation logic\n- `README.md` — this file\n\nNo storage, network requests, packages, or external assets are used.\n",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
